It is stated that the following security measures were taken by Respondent No. 2 on the advice of the Delhi Police for the security of those visiting the cinema hall:
"(i) Customers were not allowed to carry bags, packages, food items, boxes etc. into the movie hall;
(ii) One doorframe metal detector and a hand metal detector are used at the main entrance (there is no other way any person can enter) and all persons entering the picture hall have to pass through the metal detectors;
(iii) After the patrons pass through the metal detectors, they are physically frisked and checked by security personnel before they can enter the auditorium;
