2 (iv) The bathrooms, dustbins, the auditorium and the space under each seat is checked before each show;
(v) Parking lot attendants check all the cars including the undercarriage, by using mirrors;
(vi) A slide is shown on the screen requesting the patrons to immediately inform the management, if they see any unidentified object;"
